Phase 2 — Redesign Employee Homepage (Template + Designer Collection)
Goal: Redesign the homepage with a random hero template, two CTA buttons ("Start with Questions" / "Skip"), and a scrollable "Designer Collection" section showing randomized retailer designs.

Files to Modify
File	Action
Employee page.jsx
Full rewrite of the server component
Files to Create
File	Purpose
components/employee/EmployeeHomeClient.jsx	Client component for the interactive homepage
components/employee/DesignerCollectionSection.jsx	Randomized retailer designs grid + "View All" link
Implementation Details
Random Template Assignment:

Store 4 static vertical hero images (Cloudinary URLs or /public assets)
On server-side render, use a seeded random selection per employee: templateIndex = employee.id.charCodeAt(0) % 4
This ensures the same employee always sees the same template but different employees see different ones
Homepage Layout (top → bottom):

Hero Section: Full-width image (from assigned template) + overlay text + two buttons
Button A: "Start with Questions" → navigates to /dashboard/employee/questionnaire
Button B: "Skip to Playground" → navigates to /dashboard/employee/playground
Designer Collection Section (scrollable):
Title: "Designer Collection"
Fetch retailer's own designs (retailer_designs table) where is_archived = false
Randomize order per employee using a shuffle seeded by employee.id
Show a grid of product cards (no category grouping — everything mixed)
Bottom: "View All →" button → links to Catalogue page with ?tab=retailer to show only Retailer Collection
Data Fetching (server component):

employee → retailer_id → retailer_designs (shuffled) → pass to client
