Phase 4 — Playground Page (Filtered Products)
Goal: Build the Playground page that shows wholesaler products approved by the retailer, filtered by questionnaire answers (or unfiltered if "Skip" was clicked).

Files to Create
File	Purpose
app/dashboard/employee/playground/page.jsx	Server component — fetches products from retailer_selections + applies filters
components/employee/PlaygroundClient.jsx	Client component — product grid + selection + product detail modal
Implementation Details
Data Source: Products come from the retailer's "Your Taste" selections:

employee → retailer_id → retailer_selections → products (where is_published = true)
Filtering Logic (server-side):

If query params are present (from questionnaire):
occasion → match against product style or category fields
material → match against metal_purity (gold/silver/etc.)
type → match against jewellery_type or category
weight → filter by net_weight ranges
If no query params (Skip was clicked): show all retailer-approved products
Client Component Features:

Product grid (similar to existing WholesalerGalleryClient)
Product cards with image, title, weight, toggle/select functionality
Clicking a product → opens ProductInfoModal (already exists)
Selection mechanism: Employee can tap/click to select items → selected items get a visual indicator (checkmark overlay)
"View Selected" floating button appears when items are selected → navigates to the Selection Review page (Phase 5)
✅ Testing Checklist — Phase 4
